{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_5331cb469b82","title":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158104&idx=1&sn=6bd13ca3a5b1465dd8482fd828ee2407&chksm=f0561b07144f4589b0e0c6614dfca7ad74a37af7f52fda00274839714ed188165de3bc8f1b73&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"每天为大家精选各类情报分析相关的资源、工具、技巧和资讯，努力成为情报分析师必备的工具箱。外挂机器人“小丁丁”还能陪您聊天，给您查航班、查列车、查天气、查酒店、查美食、查股票、回答您的提问等等。","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"丁爸 情报分析师的工具箱","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FUGrobmT8GcLqtMLDWHBic3PZ9IicdJxicSLTTBibQicVAuj4AGD0LclNYnTwuHbwWvGlrsVxZCvB2GwE%2F0","updated":"2026-11-26T01:33:47.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158104:1","title":"【资料】美国国际开发署（USAID)247份文件","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158104&idx=1&sn=6bd13ca3a5b1465dd8482fd828ee2407&chksm=f0561b07144f4589b0e0c6614dfca7ad74a37af7f52fda00274839714ed188165de3bc8f1b73&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"最近，很久没有信息的美国国际开发署官网（https://www.usaid.gov/）放出了247份文件。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGF0QAZha8m6bmZwsCL7UXicx1TbupWcKId6iaJ6JhWcqLKjY50QFq33JkVHpdS9de2ibrp9D9OUdAiaaeas5tJ7ib82rictJ3N4tsQY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-26T01:33:47.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158098:1","title":"【开源报告】开源情报在美国情报界的战略地位、实际作用与重要性分析","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158098&idx=1&sn=94e1c60842d349a45acf8706fb71f88c&chksm=f06efabf504aedfaf7a5e8a6c60e93c7d7d45bb815116c4e9c701fe48b6d643e6837b2bf4a59&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"开源情报（OSINT）在美国情报界已完成\"从辅助手段到基础性学科\"的制度性跃升，但这一跃升在不同维度上并不均衡——政策与治理层面已明确核心化，资源与流程层面仍存在显著张力，能力层面则以\"与秘密情报互补而非替代\"为基本定位。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NF3pLPiabaHknsJjEeB2UujOrFQITpSI4Z0z5GWRm6s4VD9ddI3CiazjzJtKWyeZNC6MVNRrmheI3GrNFOKKfnIny2vSRub6DW9M%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158093:1","title":"【开源报告】美国情报高级研究计划署（IARPA）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158093&idx=1&sn=0d3e91ac1d1a4cf447c2fb1a68094ecf&chksm=f01cf21b5d5200e227dae6235eb10a7ae8cd90c515bcebd4832a26e87269270aca1ad12f72cd&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"IARPA 是美国国家情报总监办公室下设的高风险、高回报科研资助机构，成立于 2007 年，被普遍视为情报界的DARPA 复制体：不设实验室、不做自有研究，而是以任期制的项目经理为核心，通过竞争性招标把研究外包给高校、企业和实验室，再把成果转移给情报界用户。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NE5kTSsSAkytqH3gdF6zT5JYvBgSCyzA7rC0VZeAMf49BCEmGb893ICTtQhPD45HDokPXzK4aVa1Mh1cUOj2EPibZgE1ibexvWOI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158088:1","title":"【开源报告】开源情报基金会（OSINT Foundation）机构调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158088&idx=1&sn=9be5e0d37772aba97c0f0f48607d3933&chksm=f01a309a24ba602bb9a5d32dc3bffe76429afba201b6aa6654380c023bf87a31bb16cf56afda&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"基金会自称为服务美国国家安全开源情报（OSINT）从业者的非营利专业协会与公众教育资源，战略目标为“发展从业者社群、规范化技能与认证、推动 OSINT 项目化与代表性”，明确不生产、不存储 OSINT，也不以执法或商业 OPEN-SOURCE 调查为主要对象。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGnOCib3s5M9gQX2FnCy3jz3nMIwiaTdibaKkWU3oxxYPqmiaU671c1yB9G8rxlYhjrvPSI1CRRAzaicwiaT9q2nDfkp8ZgXQvUES9Sw%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158088:2","title":"【资料】情报研究指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158088&idx=2&sn=09ddf1079aae1d34f92fd2a7b1b1bc20&chksm=f0beb8b4973a4179d2c580ef3adedf4c5b968629a50eb4c8d3e361d4aaf078d3bc9f4d03ef74&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"指南把“如何教、如何学、如何研究”这一复杂的问题，转化为一套可由教育者直接使用的结构化资源。它以七部分框架覆盖了从概念界定、历史演进、学科分类到政策监督与国际比较的完整知识链；以“平衡、完整、可支撑”的选材规范保证了作为教学材料的可靠性；","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NHfBIQowztDgHd1rkIdWYZ33kRiabUIazP1XtTx7fYIzjiawRm3Z8EedsH8mHx2YGqiaRRbWzFZow3KUbHf55KGCYjNeQcic3ciadOE%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158080:1","title":"【开源报告】全球开源情报（OSINT） 活动生态与区域发展 调研报告","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158080&idx=1&sn=52660aba601a781b5993e385aa14a172&chksm=f0bff8294a453ba3badc1dd97b642ed03250ba178d398b9b59b348b95e7558a1f8e7a8cbc12a&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"全球OSINT活动生态呈现“双极引领、多中心跟进”的格局：美国以“战略—协会—会展—荣誉”四位一体的制度化体系领先，中国以“学会主导、总体国家安全观统领、政产学研用协同”的技术产业化路径快速追赶，二者构成全球OSINT活动生态的两极。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGuANwKPkDx9JLpfnnZe9oVQtNToItCXPAwZAQTZYssf81uTXr1P51Vd0ADtgRrl60sZFvw10zyrjBurtWavDQSESSs6AtbVAY%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-22T05:42:50.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158075:1","title":"【开源报告】美国情报界与军方 开源情报（OSINT） 活动年表","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158075&idx=1&sn=d7f7afaa88e3f4200232093e1921aa4b&chksm=f0bf9ca8eb360f72ae639f848e3e9b534ffe35526f8f60212ce5d3ef350b3acfc97f1ba0f302&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"本年在表系统梳理美国情报界与军方开源情报（OSINT）领域的会议、论坛、展览、颁奖及政策里程碑，时间跨度自 1941 年学科起源至 2026 年 11 月。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NHibgcDwCaC5M0Ld5pKhwQbkmyXGUJuucGTmXu4jxy7STW1SB18VQ0icqXe2R403VZX5gnDMh4BHLXS7zGa8LT0JJIY3p7hxFy7s%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158075:2","title":"第六届全国开源情报技术大会在贵阳成功举办","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158075&idx=2&sn=34c27a0a2e40be6ccdc8c35388bca0a2&chksm=f013ba334491f36465769b9cfc7c12692ccd3ac205c152b8e4c3e375f0a8033409fae027adfb&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"2026年11月14日至15日第六届全国开源情报技术大会在贵阳成功举办","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NFsibxAH5CiaibAibU7wS78cSvVJibkeibSkMu2cicnqA9cyO8vxMoK6ibBQmouLCVjHPhv6eRkHMkMhJA6hzyflrQPSicFyu8XeuI5Jn1c%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-20T22:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158068:1","title":"【技巧】人工智能赋能开源情报（OSINT）实操指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158068&idx=1&sn=e8a0450ed82aa22f2a3e18d25fb69f1f&chksm=f074af348c87a7e3f226240c33ac97c12c24d28cc292e92874b710c48eeed36a2b0af197e5e2&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"AI 在 OSINT 中的正确定位是放大器，不是替代品。放大器意味着：输入垃圾，输出更多垃圾；输入没有验证的线索，输出看起来更可信的谣言。所以本指南把“验证”放在与“采集”同等重要的位置。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEboIRFsiczZGic1OKbGhH5sdhdpBKSnKcv8RDkuVTlC85ABZEFT8COYN6dAQgOh2eeMOFb0aQcfaczIeVibiabOtMGfb0ntpkrll4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T03:25:21.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158056:1","title":"【开源报告】俄乌战争中的俄罗斯军事情报： 失误、适应与代价（2022–2026）","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158056&idx=1&sn=3c18cd4527bd957984b1e20002518c71&chksm=f03e8f58b5e8246d1613a2840538985914a9735598fd48df38e4d2c3e6210a1ca2972748019c&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"俄罗斯军事情报在战术—技术维度完成了战争史上罕见的快速学习，在战略—制度维度（评估独立性、问责、反间谍专业度）改进有限。这一不对称意味着：俄情报对\"已知战场\"的支撑持续增强，对\"未知变量\"（对手突然性、领导层偏见、己方制度缺陷）依然脆弱。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NGzMQvbDD13YhLzSmuj3qib4XaykyMWSxWUOyib2dyNMfs4YtJIFSppoeriaILHKgZaeM75yEdwYQvtzbb0zNwvJZKjK987NjQRv0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-16T03:49:42.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158051:1","title":"【资料】最新CIA的情报研究杂志内容介绍","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158051&idx=1&sn=dadacb4c60fc7a13282aee499f28c8e7&chksm=f04b56a7a553051af82a0481f2f04f381d2425f4b0539f6a68c21a6d60b42899875c8f3146c8&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"今天给大家介绍美国中情局情报研究中心（Center for the Study of Intelligence）主办的专业期刊《Studies in Intelligence》第 70 卷第 3 期（节选版，2026 年 9 月）。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NFDWWdkL6icddxL5cOxNicxUqtNZNfBIp0DAqoZBTy6BUAdvNdjBu7XfkdKC6N0HwCmI42gBJLtF72cia4UB37RAnpCIFKdhdqtAs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-15T02:36:07.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw%3D%3D:2651158046:1","title":"【开源技巧】AIS 定位异常船舶挖掘实用指南","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MTE0NTE3Mw==&mid=2651158046&idx=1&sn=826fdddb9b889819d51060b25068b08f&chksm=f0ef03318cc13ac91b65e4f050cf4c56183f4ebbbf90a4ec7d2cf25a1cf7ad573be630a60af7&scene=126&sessionid=1795679788#rd","description":"AIS 定位异常船舶挖掘实用指南适用对象：海事态势感知分析员、合规与制裁筛查团队、海警/海关情报岗、航运风险尽调人员，以及搭建\"暗船\"检测流水线的数据工程师。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2Fno8YFGgia2NEMA2Gt7T52gBAicTrYdXRwiaIWCRrbkkRptu5f29lgoOfgpXWsDIhjCdTPlRt0DxayBdS31D3BmAODsczg7YKyoRr27PDed2Gpg%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T08:27:48.000Z"}]}